syntax:
Overloaded function set:

return_type function_name(parameter_list);

Where multiple functions share the same name but differ in parameter types, number, or qualifiers.

Function call:

function_name(argument_list);

code_example:
int calc(int, int);
int calc(const int, const int);

void example() {
    calc(5, 10); // Calls calc(int, int)
    calc((const int)5, (const int)10); // Calls calc(const int, const int)
    calc(5, (const int)10); // Ambiguous if both match equally
}
